<title>POLAND: Jutrzenka prices new issue at PLN 67.</title>
<headline>Jutrzenka prices new issue at PLN 67.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:				   Jutrzenka</p>
<p>SA confectioner</p>
<p> Type of issue:			  new common stock</p>
<p> Priced at (PLN):			67</p>
<p> Previous Pricing Range:	     55 or 67 PLN*</p>
<p> No of Shares Offered:		 1,000,000</p>
<p> No of Existing Shares:		2,573,222</p>
<p> Lead Manager:			   COK Bank Handlowy</p>
<p> Lead Underwriter:		     Wood Securities B.V.</p>
<p> Use Of Proceeds:			purchase of machinery</p>
<p> No of shares offered:		 1,000,000</p>
<p> No of Existing Shares:		2,573,222</p>
<p> Subscription Period:		   April 16-17**</p>
<p>NOTE: * The minimum price was to have been PLN 55 if the WIG index on April 2 was below 13,200 points and at PLN 67 zlotys if it was above that level.</p>
<p>	    **If not all the shares are taken, on April 16-17 the</p>
<p>company will offer the remaining shares on April 23-24</p>
<p>1996  Earnings Data (million PLN)</p>
<p>    Set profit: 10.3</p>
<p>    Pre-tax:    17.3</p>
<p>    Sales:     127.9</p>
<p>Main Shareholder: S.G.Warburg - 5.53 pct of shares</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
